07)------------HashJoinExec: mode=CollectLeft, join_type=Left, on=[(i_manufact@0, i_manufact@1)], projection=[i_product_name@1, item_cnt@2, __always_true@4]
08)--------------DataSourceExec: file_groups={1 group: [[${WORK_DIR}/item.vortex]]}, projection=[i_manufact, i_product_name], file_type=vortex, predicate: i_manufact_id@13 >= 738 AND i_manufact_id@13 <= 778
09)--------------ProjectionExec: expr=[count(Int64(1))@1 as item_cnt, i_manufact@0 as i_manufact, true as __always_true]
